    "arxiv": "1705.10940v4",
    "theorem": 11,
    "odd_order_statement": "if an arc A has size q+2-t and |A|>2t+2, a nonzero degree-2t dual polynomial restricts on every point-pencil to the square of that point's tangent polynomial",
